moving to -2, as it represents a cautious step down from the current neutral position, allowing us to explore the feasibility of slightly more negative values while maintaining stability.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Analyst A, to infer more about their utility functions and adjust my strategy accordingly, potentially aiming for a compromise value or pushing downward more cautiously.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "659b003c-b075-454e-8da6-9c190946432d"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-3</VALUE>\nThis proposal makes a slight adjustment downward from the current position, aiming to gauge the group's reaction while maintaining caution.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, especially from Critic C and Analyst A, to refine my understanding of their utility functions and adjust my strategy accordingly, potentially aiming for further downward adjustments or seeking a compromise value.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "659b003c-b075-454e-8da6-9c190946432d"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "659b003c-b075-454e-8da6-9c190946432d"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\nThis step aims to move slightly higher, exploring the feasibility of a more neutral position without overly deviating from the current stance.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Delegate D, to gauge their tolerance for positive adjustments and refine my understanding of their utility functions, potentially informing a strategy to either stabilize around a mutually acceptable value or advocate for further upward movement.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "659b003c-b075-454e-8da6-9c190946432d"}, {"answer": "\nGiven the group's tendency towards cautious movements, I propose <VALUE>-2</VALUE> to encourage a more decisive stance.\nThis step aims to exp